Her assistant came
to her and said,

00:07:39.992 --> 00:07:42.595 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Isabelle Stevenson is being
honored at some event.

00:07:42.595 --> 00:07:43.863 align:start size:94% position:6%
Would you like
to send a message?"

00:07:43.863 --> 00:07:48.000 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Kristen was doing a thin
with muffins at the time,

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.237 align:start size:94% position:6%
so she said, "Why don't we
send her a basket of muffins?"

00:07:51.237 --> 00:07:52.972 align:start size:94% position:6%
Right? So, she sent
a basket of muffins.

00:07:52.972 --> 00:07:55.641 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then, a week later,
Isabelle Stevenson's son

00:07:55.641 --> 00:07:58.878 align:start size:94% position:6%
called up Kristen and said
"Thank you so much.

00:07:58.878 --> 00:08:00.079 line:92%
It was such a thoughtful gesture

00:08:00.079 --> 00:08:02.081 align:start size:94% position:6%
for you to send
a basket of muffins

00:08:02.081 --> 00:08:03.716 size:88% position:44% line:92%
to my mother's funeral."

00:08:03.716 --> 00:08:05.251 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:08:05.251 --> 00:08:08.287 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she was --
And so, there's the coffin

00:08:08.287 --> 00:08:10.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
and all these
bouquets of flowers,

00:08:10.056 --> 00:08:12.558 line:92%
and then muffins from Kristen.

00:08:12.558 --> 00:08:13.326 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:08:13.326 --> 00:08:16.395 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I said to her, "Oh, my God
did you say anything?

00:08:16.395 --> 00:08:18.698 align:start size:94% position:6%
Was there any message on it?
And she went, "Yes.

00:08:18.698 --> 00:08:21.934 line:92%
'Congratulations, Isabelle!'

00:08:21.934 --> 00:08:24.270 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:26.839
-I think we could all use
just a quick little break,

00:08:26.839 --> 00:08:30.243
and then we'll be right back
with more from Alan Cumming.

